#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Basics</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>基础</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Company specific offers</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>公司专属优惠</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Do you want to go further?</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>想要更进一步吗？</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Final word</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>最后说明</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>In such situation, feel free to experiment with this database and "
"then to create a new one for your own usage.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>在这种情况下，欢迎您随时在此数据库中进行体验，然后为您的实际使用创建"
"一个新的数据库。</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Multiple resource blocking / period closure</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>多资源锁定 / 时段关闭</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Shared offers</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>共享优惠</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Single resource blocking</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>单个资源阻塞</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Use case</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>使用案例</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"A price at 0 combined with the setting \"Hide Add To Cart\" prevents "
"bookings from your website!"
msgstr "价格为 0 并配合“隐藏加入购物车”设置，会阻止客户从您的网站进行预订！"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model:product.template,name:holiday_house.product_template_13
msgid "A-frame Cabin"
msgstr ""

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Access the rates from the same menu to see how price rules apply during the "
"year."
msgstr "在同一菜单中访问费率，即可查看价格规则在一年中如何生效。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Access to more details clicking the slot."
msgstr "点击该时段可查看更多详情。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid ""
"Accommodation were exactly what we needed for a family moment.<br/>Many "
"thanks agan."
msgstr "住宿正是我们家庭时光所需要的。<br/>非常感谢。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Add here as many of them as needed."
msgstr "根据需要在此添加任意数量。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Adjust the number of stars, leave a comment and send it!"
msgstr "调整星级评分，留下评论并发送！"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Adjust the rental dates, click the book button and then proceed to checkout."
msgstr "调整租赁日期，点击预订按钮，然后进行结算。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Adjust your prices along the year"
msgstr "按季节调整您的价格"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Adjusting your offers in consequence"
msgstr "相应调整您的优惠"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Again, the <strong>Holiday House App </strong>helps you manage the end of "
"the stay!"
msgstr "同样，<strong>度假民宿应用 </strong>可以帮助您管理住宿的收尾工作！"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.custom_product_name
msgid "All Houses"
msgstr "所有房屋"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively to individual resource blocking slots described earlier, you "
"can select a resource this leave applies to."
msgstr ""
"除了前面介绍的单个资源锁定时段之外，您还可以选择本条休假记录所适用的资源。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, switch to the list view, which is more suitable if the "
"booking is not during the visualized date range and update the booking date "
"range."
msgstr ""
"或者，切换到列表视图；如果预订不在当前可视日期范围内，列表视图更合适，可在其"
"中更新预订的日期范围。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, type in the search bar and select the appropriate filter."
msgstr "或者，在搜索栏中输入并选择适当的筛选条件。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can create a slot as placeholder from the planning "
"directly:"
msgstr "或者，您可以直接在排期中创建一个占位时段："

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid ""
"Amazing stay at the heart of a pine tree forest. Resourcing and peaceful. "
"<br/>Lovely furnished with all the necessary, even including games such as "
"Mölkky. <br/>I can only recommend!"
msgstr ""
"住在松林深处的绝佳体验。令人放松又宁静。<br/>屋内布置温馨、设施一应俱全，甚至"
"还有 Mölkky 等桌游。<br/>强烈推荐！"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:holiday_house.product_template_12
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:holiday_house.product_template_13
#: model_terms:product.template,website_description:holiday_house.product_template_14
msgid "An address must be specified for a map to be embedded"
msgstr "必须指定一个地址才能嵌入地图"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Anyone can create a portal account on your database.<br/>\n"
"Open your website home page in a private tab to do so."
msgstr ""
"任何人都可以在您的数据库上创建门户账户。<br/>\n"
"请在隐私标签页中打开您的网站首页进行注册。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Assign them a resource, which helps you keeping track."
msgstr "为他们分配资源，便于您跟踪管理。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At any time from the guest order, use the Send message capability in the "
"chatter to exchange with your guest."
msgstr "随时可以在宾客订单中，通过 chatter 的“发送消息”功能与您的宾客沟通。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At any time you can adjust the city tax count delivered by re-opening the "
"city tax widget clicking the City Tax button on the guest order."
msgstr ""
"您可以随时在宾客订单上点击“城市税”按钮，重新打开城市税组件来调整已交付的城市"
"税数量。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model:product.template,name:holiday_house.product_template_14
msgid "Beach House"
msgstr ""

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Because keeping an eye on your business performance matter, the module comes "
"with a dedicated dashboard."
msgstr "由于关注经营绩效十分重要，本模块自带一个专用仪表板。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Beyond daily operations, the Steering menu serves as the \"Captain’s "
"Bridge\" of your holiday houses. It provides a 500-day horizon to anticipate "
"market trends, manage risks, and optimize your revenue."
msgstr ""
"除日常运营之外，“经营”菜单就是您度假民宿的“船长驾驶台”。它提供 500 天的展望"
"期，帮助您预判市场趋势、管理风险并优化收入。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Blocking resources"
msgstr "锁定资源"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Booking a house"
msgstr "预订房屋"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By default, Odoo brings taxes and fiscal positions into your database "
"depending on your location. These are pre-configured to ease your selling "
"abroad, but they may require a small configuration if you need to apply the "
"local tax rate even to foreign customers."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Odoo 会根据您所在的位置将税项和应税设定导入您的数据库。这些都已预"
"先配置好，方便您向境外销售；但如果您需要对境外客户也适用当地税率，则可能需要"
"做些小配置。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By uploading this module's demo data, your database has been filled with a "
"few products, sale orders and more."
msgstr "上传此模块的演示数据后，您的数据库中已填充了若干产品、销售订单等信息。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your customer for the resulting amount and you're all set!"
msgstr "按计算出的金额向客户收款，就大功告成了！"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your guests"
msgstr "向客人收费"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Check and adjust if needed the number of guest who stayed in each room. Then "
"confirm the number of city tax to be charged, which updated the delivered "
"city tax count."
msgstr ""
"核对并在需要时调整每个房间入住的客人数。然后确认应收取的城市税数量，系统会据"
"此更新已交付的城市税数量。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests in"
msgstr "办理客人入住"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests out"
msgstr "办理客人退房"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check the invoice data and confirm it."
msgstr "核对发票资料，然后确认。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"City Taxes are to be billed to spent nights in practice and not in theory "
"and are counted as the sum of nights each guest stayed."
msgstr "城市税按实际入住的晚数而非理论晚数计收，即每位客人入住晚数的总和。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click one of the house to book."
msgstr "点击其中一处房屋进行预订。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the Check in button to confirm they are now staying at your place!"
msgstr "点击“入住”按钮确认客人现已入住！"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Check out button to capture they return you the keys."
msgstr "点击“退房”按钮记录客人归还钥匙。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Create Order to open the order form."
msgstr "点击“创建订单”打开订单表单。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Invoice button with a full invoice."
msgstr "在完整发票上点击“开票”按钮。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the Pay with demo button, and then Pay button to mimic the payment."
msgstr "点击“演示支付”按钮，然后点击“支付”按钮模拟支付过程。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the tail of the corresponding booking and drag it to the requested "
"date."
msgstr "点击相应预订的尾部并将其拖拽到要求的日期。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a new leave selecting the appropriate working schedule, the one from "
"your stay resources."
msgstr "新建休假单据时，请选用住宿资源对应的适用排班方案。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a new leave the same way as previously, but this time specify the "
"resource this applies to."
msgstr "按与之前相同的方式新建一条休假记录，但这次请指定该休假所适用的资源。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Created offers are assigned no company nor branch (default behavior).<br/>As "
"a result, they are available from all companies and branches, as well as all "
"websites from those."
msgstr ""
"创建的报价单不会被分配到任何公司或分支机构（默认行为）。<br/>因此，所有公司和"
"分支机构以及其所属的所有网站均可访问这些报价单。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Define start and end date time and save your leave."
msgstr "定义开始和结束日期时间，然后保存休假记录。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Discover more about Odoo by diving into our"
msgstr "发掘有关 Odoo 的更多信息，请了解我们的"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Discover the basics of this package and explore all the possibilities Odoo "
"offers to improve your experience."
msgstr "发掘该软件包的基础知识，探索 Odoo 为改善您的体验而提供的所有可能性。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Don't forget to replicate the Booking Blocker rule on all your pricelists "
"and to specify the website this applies to.<br/>On a regular basis postpone "
"this booking blocker start date season after season to unlock your calendar."
msgstr ""
"别忘了在所有价目表上复制“预订立即可锁定规则”，并指定其适用的网站。<br/>请定期"
"在每个季节之后推迟该预订立即可锁定规则的开始日期，以便解锁日历。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Don't forget to save your setting changes."
msgstr "别忘了保存您的设置更改。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Duplicate the sales tax that applies to your stay offer and rename the "
"duplicate to indicate that it applies locally, e.g. 15% (stay)."
msgstr ""
"复制适用于您住宿套餐的销售税，并将副本重命名以标明其仅在本地适用，例如 15%"
"（住宿）。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"During an available period, click, drag and drop on a house line to create a "
"slot."
msgstr "在可用时段内，点击并拖拽房屋行以创建时段。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Each company can have its own website!"
msgstr "每个公司都可以拥有自己的网站！"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Employee assignations"
msgstr "员工指派"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Employee would open the tasks from their portal access and update the task "
"stage."
msgstr "员工可通过门户访问打开这些任务，并更新任务阶段。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Enforce local tax rate"
msgstr "强制适用当地税率"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Enforcing weekly turnover"
msgstr "按周周转"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Example: A room for 2 is booked for 4 nights, two guests were here for the "
"first three nights but only one stayed the last night. Then the guests x "
"nights is 2x3+1x1=7."
msgstr ""
"示例：一间可住 2 人的房间被预订 4 晚，前 3 晚有两位客人入住，最后一晚只有一位"
"客人入住。则客人×晚数为 2×3+1×1=7。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid "Explore our vacation rentals"
msgstr "探索我们的度假短租"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid "Explore stunning properties to discover your next holiday spot."
msgstr "探索优质房源，发现您的下一个度假目的地。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid "Find you next holiday house in just a few clicks<br/><br/>"
msgstr "只需点击几下，即可找到您的下一处度假屋<br/><br/>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.homepage
msgid "Find your dream home"
msgstr "寻找您的梦中情房"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model:product.template,name:holiday_house.product_template_11
msgid "Free Cancellation"
msgstr "免费取消"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:holiday_house.product_template_11
msgid ""
"Free cancellation up to 48h prior your stay.<br>50% refund within the 48h."
msgstr "入住前 48 小时可免费取消。<br>48 小时内取消退款 50%。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"From the <strong>Holiday House App</strong>, you can manage your bookings."
"<br/>\n"
"The Holiday House App relies on the Rental and Planning Apps binding, with a "
"few customizations."
msgstr ""
"通过<strong>度假民宿应用</strong>，您可以管理您的预订。<br/>\n"
"度假民宿应用依托租赁和排期应用的绑定，并做了一些定制。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"From the Roles sections, you can select the companies and branches this "
"employee shall have access to as well as the default one."
msgstr "在“角色”部分，您可以选择该员工可访问的公司和分支机构，以及默认公司。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"From the search bar select the Today filter to see to check in and to check "
