msgstr "在搜索栏中选择“今天”筛选器，即可查看待入住和待退房的订单。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "From there you can add new companies."
msgstr "您可以在此添加新公司。"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Hello there!"
msgstr "您好！"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Here you can monitor past and future performance in the books, with overall "
"occupancy, average daily rate, revenue per available room and pickups!"
msgstr ""
"在这里，您可以监控账簿中过去和未来的经营表现，包括整体入住率、平均每日房价、"
"每间可售房收入和订单增量！"

